===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A sound of the kind made by a [[fiddle]].
# {{lb|en|UK|slang}} A [[confidence trick]] in which [[fake]] [[jewellery]] is sold as [[genuine]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2013|author=John Pearson|title=The Profession of Violence: The Rise and Fall of the Kray Twins|passage=Reggie had a way with him. People trusted him, and he could always pick up a few pounds when he needed them from the jargoons and the '''tweedle'''.}}

